  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NOOR Educational Program Visualising the Climate Crisis in Mainland South East Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is dedicated to 10-15 participants from Vietnam, Thailand, Cambodia and Laos. NOOR envisions an educational format which provides photojournalists with the research, photographic, journalistic, and storytelling skills to facilitate the production of honest, authentic, and deep-rooted visual storytelling. NOOR will provide the educational framework and context to develop the capacity of local photojournalists to develop impactful visual and research-based climate projects, and create new and powerful bodies of work, not only to professionally develop their practice, but to bring about immediate climate crisis awareness.</narrative>
  </description>
